{
  "slug": "temporal",
  "name": "Temporal",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Develop reliable Temporal applications with expert guidance across Python, TypeScript, Go, Java, and more. Covers the full development lifecycle, including designing durable workflows, defining activities and workers, handling retries and timeouts, debugging workflow execution issues, implementing signals and queries, managing versioning safely, writing tests, and operating applications with Temporal CLI and Temporal Cloud.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, `temporal-cloud-setup` (Set up Temporal Cloud and run a sample Workflow on it for the user, doing the work end…), `temporal-developer` (Develop, debug, and manage Temporal applications across Python, TypeScript, Go, Java, .NET and Ruby).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install temporal@claude-community` from `temporalio/claude-temporal-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
